   (LTER) {[}DEB 2224712]; USDA Long-Term Agroecosystem Research Program;
   Michigan State University AgBio Research; NSF Graduate Research
   Fellowship; W.K. Kellogg Biological Station LTER program {[}2391]; 
   {[}GNC20-312]},
Funding-Text = {We first acknowledge the farmers who contributed to this study and were
