   Adam Reimer for advice in contacting farmers and assistance in designing
   an interview instrument, as well as Gage Smith for his help with editing
   the interview transcripts. Finally, in addition to their initial
   support, we thank Julie Doll, Fahimeh Baziari, Corinn Rutkoski, Paul
   Gross, and Christina Curell for their support during the 2022 soil
   health workshop that disseminated project results to agricultural
   advisors in our community. Support for this research was provided by a
